+/// tip
+
+You can also stream responses by using `yield` directly in your *path operation function*.
+
+* For JSON data, see [Stream JSON Lines](../tutorial/stream-json-lines.md){.internal-link target=_blank}.
+* For binary data or strings, see [Stream Data](../advanced/stream-data.md){.internal-link target=_blank}.
+
+///
+
 /// note | Technical Details
 
 An `async` task can only be cancelled when it reaches an `await`. If there is no `await`, the generator (function with `yield`) can not be cancelled properly and may keep running even after cancellation is requested.
